copilot-plugin-cc, by tmathura, is a port of codex-plugin-cc
(https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc).

Changes

Changed .mjs files say so in a comment at the top. The other changed files
are listed below. Each was changed from upstream codex-plugin-cc to use
GitHub Copilot instead of Codex:

- .claude-plugin/marketplace.json
- .github/workflows/pull-request-ci.yml
- package.json
- package-lock.json

The plugin folder has its own NOTICE for the files in it.
